<title>POLAND: BROK STARTS TRADE 44 PCT ABOVE ISSUE.</title>
<headline>BROK STARTS TRADE 44 PCT ABOVE ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brewer Brok SA started trade on the Warsaw bourse's third tier at 34.5 zlotys, 43.8 percent above its initial public offering price of 24 zlotys.</p>
<p>The firm's May IPO of 287,500 shares was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>Brok, in which Holsten subsidiary AHK held a 60.1-percent stake before the issue, will list a total of 2,012,500 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
